                "quote": "| Ok [ \"backup\"; path ] -> UseCases.backup ports path |> render showBackup"
              }
            ],
            "rationale": "The change adds no new lending rule. The amount each member owes (fines less payments) still comes from the Tier 2 function Accounts.owed. Views.totalOwed only adds those amounts up across members, which is projection work and belongs in Tier 3. The new backup rules (refuse to overwrite an existing file, report a missing backup) are use-case checks in Tier 3, not lending rules. The CLI only parses the command, calls a use case and formats the view it gets back.",
            "score": 2
          },
          "ARC-REV-02": {
            "evidence": [
