                "file": "src/Lending.Application/UseCases.fs",
                "line": 179,
                "quote": "ports.Archive.Save path library"
              },
              {
                "file": "src/Lending.Host/Cli/CommandLine.fs",
                "line": 100,
                "quote": "-open Lending.Host.Persistence"
              }
            ],
            "rationale": "Every new effect goes through an existing port: Files.ReadLines checks whether the file exists, Archive.Load/Save read and write backups, and Store.Load/Save handle library state. Nothing new reads the clock or does I/O in Tier 1/2. The change also removes an existing violation: the CLI used to construct JsonFileStore directly for backup, and that call and the open of Lending.Host.Persistence are both gone.",
            "score": 2
          },
          "ARC-REV-03": {
            "evidence": [
              {
                "file": "src/Lending.Application/Views.fs",
                "line": 324,
                "quote": "let summary (library: Library) : SummaryView ="
