              {
                "file": "src/Lending.Host/Cli/CommandLine.fs",
                "line": 117,
                "quote": "let private showSummary (v: Views.SummaryView) ="
              }
            ],
            "rationale": "Each fact is defined once. The library summary is built once (Views.summary) and formatted once (showSummary), and backup, restore and backup-info all use those. The 'no backup at' error comes from a single function, loadBackup. Money formatting reuses the existing Views.money. The amount a member owes is not redefined; totalOwed calls Accounts.owed.",
            "score": 2
          }
