                "quote": "let restoreMember memberId (backup: Library) (library: Library) : Result<Library * Member * Fine list * Payment list, LendingError> ="
              },
              {
                "file": "src/Lending.Application/UseCases.fs",
                "line": 203,
                "quote": "Catalog.restoreMember (MemberId memberId) backup library"
              }
            ],
            "rationale": "The rules for restoring a member are all decided in the Tier 2 function Catalog.restoreMember: the backup must hold the member, the member must not already exist, and only their fines and payments come back, not loans, holds or reminders. The Tier 3 use case loads the backup, calls that function inside commit and builds the view from what it returns. The CLI only renders the result.",
            "score": 2
          },
