            ],
            "rationale": "The backup is read through the existing Archive port (via loadBackup), and the new state is saved through the existing commit/Store path. Catalog.restoreMember is pure: it takes the backup and the current library as values and returns a Result. No new effect appears below Tier 4.",
            "score": 2
          },
